My hint to survival of the first few levels in NetHack 3.0

(Very mild spoiler follows)

There is many dog-like animals in NetHack 3.0. They can all be tamed!
When you meet your first jackals, tame them. You can still do that by
throwing certain kind of food at them, or by killing the first and
throwing the corpse at the next! Try to have  yuor dog and 3 or 4
jackals to protect you.

When your jackals get killed, get some wolfs. You can even tame
wolfweres.

About dogs:

When you throw a food ration (or anything not dog food) at a dog, it
don't eat it it, but gets peacefull anyway.

When your dog is starving, it should eat anything.

